{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GY4qmjvpJrPm8Qy6mRATPZ","type":"tool_result","content":"  proxy. User tokens are never forwarded.\n* **Approvals.** `create_purchase_order`, `pay_invoice` and vendor messages\n  require an approval from a role listed in `config/policy.yaml`. Approval\n  requests are posted to `#approvals-<bu>` with the argument summary.\n* **Budgets.** Per-run step, time, token, cost, tool-rate and sub-agent\n  limits, plus per-user, per-business-unit and fleet quotas for daily spend\n  and run starts. See `config/policy.yaml`.\n* **Audit.** Every run step is a row in `audit_events` linked to its parent\n  step, with the six identity fields, policy version, approval id and\n  decision-time context size. The agent's database role can insert audit\n  rows but not update or delete them.\n\n## Context size\n\nLogged on every audit row as `context_tokens` and `context_method`:\n\nagent/app/killswitch.py:6:SELECT only on this table, so the agent cannot clear or delay a halt.\nagent/app/killswitch.py:16:SELECT scope, reason, set_by, set_at\nagent/app/tools/memory.py:47:            SELECT note_id, kind, body, verified, writer_instance, created_at\nagent/app/tools/documents.py:22:            SELECT doc_id, source, media_type, text\nagent/app/approvals.py:74:            SELECT id, approver, approver_role, expires_at\nagent/app/approvals.py:96:            \"SELECT tool, status, expires_at FROM approvals WHERE id = $1\", approval_id\nagent/app/main.py:74:            \"WHERE status = 'pending' AND expires_at <= now() RETURNING 1) SELECT count(*) FROM e\"\nagent/app/main.py:178:        \"SELECT email, role FROM approvers WHERE slack_user_id = $1 AND active\", slack_user","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8727aecb-6e0a-4fea-8fc2-d15ae500fcc6","uuid":"32000b49-4af9-4b40-a704-3ac357ccee57","timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:09:43.455Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  proxy. User tokens are never forwarded.\n*